(1303, 247, 'English Capsule - \"None is particularly famous, though maybe one will be. No matter. For now, they provide a modicum of bragging rights and a great amount of joy. These 10 places (in alphabetical order) are where these experts would send their friends in 2019.\"', '', NULL, '2019-01-28', '09:49:22', 0, 0, 0, 'https://www.forbes.com/sites/annabel/2018/12/10/the-10-coolest-places-to-eat-in-2019/', 'https://thumbor.forbes.com/thumbor/600x315/https%3A%2F%2Fblogs-images.forbes.com%2Fannabel%2Ffiles%2F2018%2F12%2FFSX-3FILS-1200x800.jpg', 'The 10 Coolest Places to Eat in 2019', 'I asked a few professional eaters which restaurants they find most interesting&mdash;and under-sung&mdash;right now. None is particularly famous, though maybe one will be. No matter. For now, they provide a modicum of bragging rights and a great amount of joy.', NULL, NULL),
